Template: autobricks-vpn/public-ip
Type: string
Description: Public IPv4 address:
 Enter the public IPv4 address included in the server certificate IP SAN.

Template: autobricks-vpn/vpn-network
Type: string
Default: 10.9.1.0/24
Description: VPN network:
 Enter a canonical IPv4 CIDR used by VPN clients.

Template: autobricks-vpn/vpn-address
Type: string
Default: 10.9.1.1
Description: VPN server address:
 Enter a usable host address inside the VPN network.

Template: autobricks-vpn/port
Type: string
Default: 4433
Description: VPN UDP and management web TCP port:
 The VPN server uses UDP and the local management web uses TCP on this port.

Template: autobricks-vpn/country
Type: string
Default: KR
Description: Certificate country code:
 Enter exactly two ASCII letters.

Template: autobricks-vpn/state
Type: string
Default: Seoul
Description: Certificate state or province:

Template: autobricks-vpn/locality
Type: string
Default: Seoul
Description: Certificate locality or city:

Template: autobricks-vpn/organization
Type: string
Default: Autobricks
Description: Certificate organization:

Template: autobricks-vpn/organizational-unit
Type: string
Default: VPN
Description: Certificate organizational unit:

Template: autobricks-vpn/root-ca-cn
Type: string
Default: Autobricks VPN Root CA
Description: Root CA common name:

Template: autobricks-vpn/intermediate-ca-cn
Type: string
Default: Autobricks VPN Intermediate CA
Description: Intermediate CA common name:

Template: autobricks-vpn/server-cn
Type: string
Default: Autobricks VPN Server
Description: Server certificate common name:

Template: autobricks-vpn/confirm
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Continue with this configuration?
 Select No to stop before certificates or configuration are created.
